      "Text": "Security update for podman",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for podman fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-55686: Podman: WORKDIR symlink traversal vulnerability (bsc#1268579).\n- CVE-2026-57231: specially crafted image can trick podman run into leaking host environment variables into the\n  container (bsc#1269471).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
